Subject: [PATCH] Honor configured shells in persistent terminal sessions

Resolve the local worktree or remote terminal shell before constructing shpool attach arguments. Preserve explicit program arguments and titles without forcing a login shell. Quote literal arguments and protect them from shpool template expansion. Retain the real-daemon probe, kill and idempotence checks while exercising the configured command and literal directory.
